WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Hi, I'm Sara Haddad. I run Clearwater Bookkeeping in Ottawa.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
In this course, you'll build a one-month cash flow forecast.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
We'll look at cash coming in and cash going out.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Then you'll fill in a simple worksheet.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
By the end, you'll see a short week before it arrives.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
No accounting background needed.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
If a low bank balance has ever surprised you, this is for you.
